<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoTokenCreate</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenCreate</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to create a token without a value</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoToken *SilikoTokenCreate(void);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenCreate</function> function creates a new
token with no value. The status will be
<literal>SilikoTokenUnset</literal>. Such a token may be used as a
placeholder or sentinal value.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para></para>
</refsection>
